{%- comment -%}
  EarWipes offer page — standard (evergreen) build
  =================================================
  Faithful Shopify implementation of the founder-approved Claude Design frames
  "EarWipes Standard - Desktop.dc.html" / "EarWipes Standard - Mobile.dc.html"
  (project: VetPets EarWipes Offer Page). The World Animal Week frames in the
  same project are NOT implemented here and must stay Claude-Design-only.

  Rendered only through templates/product.earwipes-offer-page.json, assigned to
  the existing live EarWipes product. The canonical product URL is unchanged;
  this page is reached via ?view=earwipes-offer-page, exactly like the proven
  FreshWipes/EyeWipes offer pages.

  COMMERCE OWNERSHIP
  ------------------
  Kaching Bundles is the source of truth for tier, quantity, deal, selling plan,
  bundle properties and free gifts. Its app block is rendered below inside the
  purchase module and its real controls stay authoritative — assets/earwipes-offer-page.css
  restyles those exact nodes to the approved design rather than cloning them.

  There is exactly ONE add-to-cart pathway: the theme's <product-form> rendered
  in `.eawof-form-host`. The sticky bar and the final offer CTA are proxies that
  submit that same form; they carry no quantity, gift or selling-plan logic.

  DEVIATIONS FROM THE DESIGN FILE (documented, not silent)
  ----------------------------------------------------------
  1. Prices: the design file ships placeholder tier prices ($43/$66/$96) with its
     own dev annotation admitting they "need confirming... confirm each figure in
     Kaching before launch." This build uses the REAL, verified Kaching config for
     the live EarWipes product (deal bars 60da5b14/542ff3c9/82e81df9 on product
     10222498513163): $41 / $70 / $104 one-time, 20% off via the shared RoutineCare
     selling plan (gid://shopify/SellingPlan/10423959819) = $32.80 / $56.00 / $83.20.
  2. "Buy 2, Get 2 Free" is founder-prohibited on this standard page. It appeared
     in the design's top bar, a tier corner badge (this is Kaching's OWN live admin
     badge text on deal bar 542ff3c9 — see the CSS's `.kaching-bundles__bar-most-popular`
     override), a CTA link and the final offer badge. All four are replaced with
     compliant copy; the Kaching-rendered badge node is hidden and replaced with a
     theme-owned "Most Popular" corner badge, same position/styling.
  3. The design's ticking "Offer ends in HH:MM:SS" countdown was dropped — it isn't
     tied to real inventory or time data, so it stays fake/resetting urgency. The
     top bar keeps a rotating message strip instead (same proven mechanism already
     used by the FreshWipes/EyeWipes offer pages).
  4. Two of the design's approved copy variants differ between the Desktop and
     Mobile frames. Where the choice affects a compliance guardrail (no "guarantees
     results within a specific timeline"), the more conservative approved variant
     was used: the guarantee card uses the Mobile title/body ("Try the routine for
     100 days...") instead of the Desktop's "Cleaner ears in three weeks", and the
     final offer card's third bullet uses the Mobile wording ("Backed by the 100-day
     money-back guarantee") instead of the Desktop's "Cleaner ears in three weeks —
     or every penny back". Every other line is the approved copy verbatim.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign product_form_id = 'eawof-product-form-' | append: section.id
-%}

{{ 'earwipes-offer-page.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ 'eawof-tier-2pack.jpg' | asset_url }}">
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ 'eawof-tier-4pack.jpg' | asset_url }}">
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ 'eawof-tier-6pack.jpg' | asset_url }}">

<div id="earwipes-offer-page" data-rc="on" data-tier="build">

  {%- comment -%} ---------- rotating announcement bar (no countdown, no scarcity copy) ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-in">
      <div class="announce" role="status" aria-label="Offer highlights">
        <span class="announce-msg" data-announce-msg>
          <svg class="announce-icon" data-announce-icon viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M11.5 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6.5a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.5 8.5a2 2 0 0 0 2.828 0l6.5-6.5a2 2 0 0 0 0-2.828l-8.5-8.5A2 2 0 0 0 11.5 3Z"></path>
            <circle cx="7.25" cy="7.25" r="1.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
          </svg>
          <span class="announce-text" data-announce-text>{{ section.settings.announce_msg1 }}</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- SECTION 1 — above the fold ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="hero" id="eawof-hero">
    <div class="hero-in">

      {%- comment -%} gallery: tier-driven slide 1 + live PDP photography {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gal">
        <div class="g-badges" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="g-pill">Build The Habit Kit · 4-Month Supply</span>
          <span class="g-pill2" hidden></span>
        </div>
        <div class="railwrap">
          <div class="rail" id="eawof-rail" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="EarWipes gallery — use left and right arrow keys">
            <div class="slide s-offer">
              <img
                class="im im-fit"
                id="eawof-tier-img"
                src="{{ 'eawof-tier-4pack.jpg' | asset_url }}"
                width="1254"
                height="1254"
                fetchpriority="high"
                decoding="async"
                alt="Four jars of VetPets EarWipes with the EarWipes e-book and a textured finger wipe">
            </div>
            {%- assign pdp_slides = 'https://shopvetpets.com/cdn/shop/files/Earww.jpg|The same dog ear photographed on day one and after fourteen days;https://shopvetpets.com/cdn/shop/files/Earww_1.jpg|Smooth wipes move buildup, textured wipes remove it;https://shopvetpets.com/cdn/shop/files/Earww_2.jpg|What came out of one ear in thirty seconds;https://shopvetpets.com/cdn/shop/files/Earww_3.jpg|Why owners switch from ear drops to EarWipes;https://shopvetpets.com/cdn/shop/files/Earww_4.jpg|Where the buildup actually starts — the part of the ear you clean;https://shopvetpets.com/cdn/shop/files/Earww_5.jpg|What to expect with a consistent daily routine;https://shopvetpets.com/cdn/shop/files/Earww_6.jpg|EarWipes compared with ear drops, cotton swabs and vet cleaning' | split: ';' -%}
            {%- for s in pdp_slides -%}
              {%- assign parts = s | split: '|' -%}
              <div class="slide s-pdp">
                <img class="im im-fit" src="{{ parts[0] }}" width="1080" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{{ parts[1] }}">
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
            <div class="slide s-pdp">
              <img class="im im-fit" src="{{ 'eawof-packshot.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="The VetPets EarWipes jar">
            </div>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="navbtn navbtn-p" aria-label="Previous image">&lsaquo;</button>
          <button type="button" class="navbtn navbtn-n" aria-label="Next image">&rsaquo;</button>
        </div>

        <div class="dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Gallery slides">
          {%- for i in (1..9) -%}
            <button type="button" class="dot{% if forloop.first %} on{% endif %}" aria-label="Slide {{ i }}"></button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <div class="thumbs" role="tablist" aria-label="Gallery thumbnails">
          <button type="button" class="thumb on" aria-label="Selected kit bundle" aria-selected="true">
            <img src="{{ 'eawof-tier-4pack.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-eawof-tier-thumb width="1254" height="1254" alt="">
          </button>
          {%- for s in pdp_slides -%}
            {%- assign parts = s | split: '|' -%}
            <button type="button" class="thumb" aria-label="{{ parts[1] }}" aria-selected="false">
              <img src="{{ parts[0] }}" width="1080" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt="">
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
          <button type="button" class="thumb" aria-label="The VetPets EarWipes jar" aria-selected="false">
            <img src="{{ 'eawof-packshot.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="">
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} purchase module {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="buy">
        <h1 class="h1">{{ section.settings.heading }}
          <span class="h1-sub">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="rating" style="margin-top:11px">
          <span class="stars" role="img" aria-label="Rated 4.9 out of 5">★★★★★</span>
          <span>4.9/5 · 15,000+ Happy Customers</span>
        </div>

        <div class="bullets">
          {%- assign bullets = 'Lifts wax and debris from the outer ear|Antibacterial texture removes odor-causing bacteria|30 seconds a day — no drops, no mess, no fight' | split: '|' -%}
          {%- for b in bullets -%}
            <div class="bullet">
              {% render 'eawof-check', size: 19 %}
              <span>{{ b }}</span>
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <div class="pick-h">{{ section.settings.picker_heading }}</div>

        {%- comment -%}
          Kaching Bundles app block — the real tier radios, the real RoutineCare
          subscription card and the real free-gift rows. Restyled by CSS, never cloned.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="eawof-kaching">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.type == '@app' -%}
              {% render block %}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- comment -%} the ONE authoritative add-to-cart pathway {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="eawof-form-host">
          {%- if product != blank -%}
            <product-form
              id="ProductForm-{{ section.id }}"
              class="product-form main-product-form"
              data-section="{{ section.id }}"
              data-main="true"
            >
              <div class="product-form__error-message-wrapper" role="alert" hidden>
                <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-error" viewBox="0 0 13 13" width="13" height="13">
                  <circle cx="6.5" cy="6.5" r="5.5" fill="#EB001B" stroke="#EB001B" stroke-width="0.7"></circle>
                  <path d="M5.87413 3.52832L5.97439 7.57216H7.02713L7.12739 3.52832H5.87413ZM6.50076 9.66091C6.88091 9.66091 7.18169 9.37267 7.18169 9.00504C7.18169 8.63742 6.88091 8.34917 6.50076 8.34917C6.12061 8.34917 5.81982 8.63742 5.81982 9.00504C5.81982 9.37267 6.12061 9.66091 6.50076 9.66091Z" fill="white"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="product-form__error-message"></span>
              </div>

              {%- form 'product',
                product,
                id: product_form_id,
                class: 'form',
                novalidate: 'novalidate',
                data-type: 'add-to-cart-form'
              -%}
                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}" class="product-variant-id">
                {%- comment -%}
                  Private line-item properties for the cart drawer's bundle image.
                  These ride the MAIN EarWipes item only. Kaching adds free gifts as
                  separate lines and its `propagate_line_properties` flag is false, so
                  gift lines never inherit them. The JS keeps tier/image in sync.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[_vp_offer_source]" value="earwipes-offer-page">
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[_vp_bundle_tier]" id="eawof-prop-tier" value="4-jar">
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[_vp_bundle_image]" id="eawof-prop-image" value="{{ 'eawof-tier-4pack.jpg' | asset_url }}">
                <button
                  id="ProductSubmitButton-{{ section.id }}"
                  type="submit"
                  name="add"
                  data-eawof-submit
                  class="atc-button product-form__submit main-product-atc cta btn-buy"
                  {% if v.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}
                >
                  <span><span data-eawof-cta-label>ADD TO CART — BUILD THE HABIT KIT</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
                </button>
              {%- endform -%}
            </product-form>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <div class="guar-row">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#13B6B5"></circle><path d="m7.4 12.3 3 3 6.2-6.6" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
          <span>100-Day Money-Back Guarantee</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pay">
          <img class="pay-strip" src="{{ 'fwof-payment-badges.webp' | asset_url }}" width="700" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Accepted payment methods: Mastercard, Visa, PayPal, American Express, Discover and Apple Pay">
        </div>

        <div class="secure">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4.5" y="10.5" width="15" height="10.5" rx="2.2" fill="#6B7A85"></rect><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.5" stroke="#6B7A85" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          <span>All transactions are secure and encrypted</span>
        </div>

        {%- render 'subscription-disclosure', frequency: section.settings.rc_frequency_label, manage_url: section.settings.manage_subscription_url -%}

        {%- comment -%} information panel {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="info">
          <div class="info-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="About EarWipes">
            <button type="button" class="info-tab on" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Vet Reviewed</button>
            <button type="button" class="info-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Ingredients</button>
            <button type="button" class="info-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">How To Use</button>
            <button type="button" class="info-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Benefits</button>
          </div>
          <div class="info-body">
            <div class="info-panel" role="tabpanel">
              <div class="vet">
                <div class="vet-eyebrow">
                  <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6 4.8 5.4v6.1c0 4.5 3 8.6 7.2 9.9 4.2-1.3 7.2-5.4 7.2-9.9V5.4L12 2.6Z" fill="#1F7FB8"></path><path d="m8.6 12.2 2.6 2.6 4.4-4.7" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
                  Veterinarian Reviewed
                </div>
                <h3 class="vet-h">A Practical Approach to Daily Ear Care</h3>
                <div class="vet-grid">
                  <p class="vet-p">EarWipes gives pet owners a simple, controlled way to help remove the visible wax and debris that collect in the outer ear each day. The textured wipes help lift buildup away instead of pushing it deeper, with no liquid to pour, making the routine easy to repeat consistently.</p>
                  <div class="vet-row">
                    <div class="vet-por"><img src="{{ 'fwpl-vet-portrait.webp' | asset_url }}" width="720" height="900" loading="lazy" alt="Dr. Michael Thompson, veterinarian at VetPets"></div>
                    <div class="vet-who">
                      <div class="vet-name">Reviewed by Dr. Michael Thompson</div>
                      <div class="vet-role">Veterinarian · VetPets</div>
                      <span class="vet-badge">
                        <svg width="9" height="9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.6 4.8 5.4v6.1c0 4.5 3 8.6 7.2 9.9 4.2-1.3 7.2-5.4 7.2-9.9V5.4L12 2.6Z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path d="m8.6 12.2 2.6 2.6 4.4-4.7" stroke="#13B6B5" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
                        Vet Reviewed
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-panel" role="tabpanel" hidden>
              <div class="info-ing">
                <div class="info-ing-r"><strong>EDI-purified water</strong> — base solution</div>
                <div class="info-ing-r"><strong>Aloe Vera (Aloe Barbadensis)</strong> — soothes and moisturizes the skin around the ear</div>
                <div class="info-ing-r"><strong>Chamomile (Chamomilla Recutita)</strong> — known for its gentle, anti-inflammatory properties</div>
                <div class="info-ing-r"><strong>Glycerin</strong> — binds moisture and protects the skin</div>
                <div class="info-ing-r"><strong>Ethylhexylglycerin</strong> — gentle preservative with antibacterial effect</div>
                <div class="info-ing-r"><strong>Decyl Glucoside</strong> — mild cleansing surfactant from plants</div>
                <div class="info-ing-r"><strong>Polyhexamethylene Biguanide Hydrochloride</strong> — antibacterial, prevents irritation</div>
                <div class="info-ing-r"><strong>Vitamin E</strong> — strengthens and protects sensitive skin</div>
              </div>
              <div class="info-free">
                <span>pH-balanced &amp; fragrance-free</span>
                <span>Cruelty-free</span>
                <span>No alcohol, parabens or sulfates</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-panel" role="tabpanel" hidden>
              <ul class="info-list">
                {%- assign howto = 'Once daily is ideal for most dogs — one wipe per ear.|Wipe the visible part of the outer ear — never push into the ear canal.|No rinsing needed — use the wipe, then discard it.|After swimming or a bath, wipe the ears dry. Consistency matters more than frequency.' | split: '|' -%}
                {%- for h in howto -%}
                  <li class="info-li">{% render 'eawof-check', size: 16 %}<span>{{ h }}</span></li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="info-panel" role="tabpanel" hidden>
              <ul class="info-list">
                {%- assign benefits = 'Textured surface lifts wax and debris without pushing it deeper.|Antibacterial texture removes odor-causing bacteria.|Safe for puppies, adult dogs and sensitive ears — no alcohol, no harsh chemicals.|A 30-second routine you can actually keep up with.|No liquid mess — and no wrestling with ear-drop bottles.' | split: '|' -%}
                {%- for b in benefits -%}
                  <li class="info-li">{% render 'eawof-check', size: 16 %}<span>{{ b }}</span></li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="urg">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 22 20H2L12 3Z" fill="#D64545"></path><path d="M12 9.5v4.5" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1.2" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle></svg>
          <div class="urg-t">We are selling out more than expected. <strong>Order now before we run out again.</strong></div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- SECTION 2 — marquee ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign claims = '45,000+ Happy Dog Owners|100-Day Money-Back Guarantee|pH-Balanced & Fragrance-Free|Works In 30 Seconds A Day' | split: '|' -%}
  <div class="mq">
    <ul class="eawof-sr">
      {%- for c in claims -%}<li>{{ c }}</li>{%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
    <div class="mq-track">
      {%- for group in (1..2) -%}
        <div class="mq-group" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- for copy in (1..2) -%}
            {%- for c in claims -%}
              <span class="mq-item"><span>{{ c }}</span>{% render 'eawof-paw' %}</span>
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- SECTION 3 — proof ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="col-c">
      <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-red">See it for yourself</div>
      <h2 class="h2">The proof is <span class="accent">on the pad</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">One pass around the accessible outer ear. Then look at the wipe.</p>
      <div class="proof-grid">
        {%- assign proofs = 'eawof-proof-light.jpg|Light wax and debris lifted from a dog’s outer ear onto an EarWipes wipe;eawof-proof-medium.jpg|A moderate amount of wax and debris lifted onto an EarWipes wipe;eawof-proof-heavy.jpg|Heavy wax and debris buildup lifted onto an EarWipes wipe' | split: ';' -%}
        {%- for pr in proofs -%}
          {%- assign pp = pr | split: '|' -%}
          <div class="imw proof-tile">
            <img class="im" src="{{ pp[0] | asset_url }}" width="1448" height="1086" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{{ pp[1] }}">
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      <p class="body-copy">That brown is wax and debris that was sitting in the outer ear. How much comes off varies from dog to dog — paper towels and cotton pads tend to push it deeper instead of lifting it out.</p>
      <a class="cta btn-outline" href="#eawof-hero">Shop The Routine ↑</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- SECTION 3B — why texture matters ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="sec" id="eawof-mech">
    <div class="col-c">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="white-space:nowrap">Why texture matters</div>
      <h2 class="h2">Why <span class="accent">textured wipes</span> lift what smooth wipes leave behind</h2>
      <p class="lead">A smooth wipe glides across the surface. EarWipes' raised texture creates more contact points to catch and lift wax and debris from the outer ear.</p>

      <div class="mech-grid">
        <div class="mech-card mech-plain">
          <span class="mech-label">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.5" stroke="#8494A0" stroke-width="2"></circle><path d="m8.6 8.6 6.8 6.8m0-6.8-6.8 6.8" stroke="#8494A0" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
            Ordinary smooth wipe
          </span>
          <div class="imw mech-media"><img class="im" src="{{ 'eawof-smooth-wipe.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1448" height="1086" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="An ordinary smooth wipe"></div>
          <h3 class="mech-h">Slides over stubborn buildup</h3>
          <p class="mech-p">A flat surface makes limited contact with dried wax, allowing buildup to stay in the folds of the ear.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mech-card mech-blue">
          <span class="mech-label mech-label-on">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#13B6B5"></circle><path d="m7.4 12.3 3 3 6.2-6.6" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Textured EarWipes wipe
          </span>
          <div class="imw mech-media"><img class="im" src="{{ 'eawof-textured-wipe.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1448" height="1086" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="The textured EarWipes wipe"></div>
          <h3 class="mech-h">Raised texture helps lift it away</h3>
          <p class="mech-p">The soft raised pattern reaches around the buildup, helping catch and lift wax and debris during the daily wipe.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mech-row">
        <div class="mech-item">
          <span class="mech-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#1F7FB8"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="12" r="2"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"></circle></svg></span>
          <span><span class="mech-it">Textured surface</span><span class="mech-id">More contact with wax and debris in the outer ear.</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="mech-item">
          <span class="mech-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#1F7FB8"><path d="M12 2.8c3.4 4.3 6.4 8 6.4 11.4A6.4 6.4 0 0 1 12 21.2a6.4 6.4 0 0 1-6.4-7c0-3.4 3-7.1 6.4-11.4Z"></path></svg></span>
