    { "type": "text", "id": "rc_frequency_label", "label": "RoutineCare billing frequency", "default": "28 days" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "manage_subscription_url", "label": "Manage Subscription link", "default": "https://shopvetpets.com/pages/manage-subscription" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Kaching deal IDs" },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Verified 2026-09-17 from the live EarWipes product (gid://shopify/Product/10222498513163) deal-block config. If a deal is rebuilt in Kaching, update the ID here — the page falls back to on-page order if an ID no longer matches."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "deal_start", "label": "Start The Routine Kit deal ID (2 Month Supply, $41)", "default": "60da5b14-2381-4859-9876-186cc95a2d62" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "deal_build", "label": "Build The Habit Kit deal ID (4 Month Supply, $70)", "default": "542ff3c9-8b85-489a-9891-d137cf7eb560" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "deal_multi", "label": "Multi-Pet Relief Plan deal ID (6 Month Supply, $104)", "default": "82e81df9-215a-4903-a3c1-e5e6c864d067" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "FAQ" },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "faq_questions",
      "label": "Questions (one per line, max 8)",
      "default": "How soon will I see a difference?\nAre EarWipes safe for sensitive ears and puppies?\nCan the wax and the odor come back?\nHow often should I use EarWipes, and do I need to rinse afterward?\nWhat if my dog dislikes having their ears touched?\nHow long does one jar last, and which plan should I choose?\nWhat makes EarWipes different from paper towels, cotton pads and ear drops?\nHow do RoutineCare and the 100-day money-back guarantee work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "faq_answers",
      "label": "Answers (one per line, same order)",
      "default": "You may see the wax and debris EarWipes removes on the wipe from the very first use. How quickly the ears look and smell cleaner depends on how much buildup is present, how long it has been there and how consistently you follow the routine.\nEarWipes are designed for gentle external use on the outer ear of dogs, including puppies and sensitive ears, when used as directed. Use a fresh wipe for each ear and never push the wipe into the ear canal. If your dog has persistent redness, swelling, pain, discharge or constant head shaking, contact your veterinarian.\nEarWipes remove the wax, dirt and debris that collect in the outer ear. Because moisture and wax are produced continuously, buildup and odor can gradually return if the daily routine is stopped — particularly after swimming or a bath.\nUse EarWipes once daily as part of your dog's regular care routine. With a fresh wipe for each ear, gently clean the visible part of the outer ear, then discard the wipe. No rinsing, mixing or preparation is needed.\nStart slowly and let your dog sniff the wipe first. Choose a calm moment, keep the first sessions short and reward relaxed behavior afterward. Never force the routine. Most dogs become more comfortable when the process stays gentle, predictable and quick.\nEach EarWipes jar contains 50 wipes. Used once a day, one jar typically lasts around seven weeks for one dog. Start The Routine Kit is the smallest option, Build The Habit Kit provides a longer routine, and the Multi-Pet Relief Plan is best suited to longer use or homes with more than one pet. Actual duration depends on the number of pets and wipes used.\nEarWipes are made specifically for daily external care of the outer ear. Their raised textured surface creates more contact with wax and debris and lifts it away, while paper towels and cotton pads can push it deeper. There is no liquid to pour, so the routine avoids the mess of ear-drop bottles. EarWipes are pre-moistened, pH-balanced, fragrance-free and alcohol-free.\nRoutineCare saves 20% and includes free shipping on every recurring order. Deliveries can be skipped, changed or cancelled when needed. Your purchase is also protected by our 100-day money-back guarantee—if EarWipes are not right for your pet, contact VetPets within 100 days of purchase for help with your refund."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "EarWipes offer page" }]
